# Python bytecode — must NOT be tracked.
# Stale .pyc files committed alongside .py files cause Odoo upgrades to
# silently run old code (e.g. `from . import wizard` missing), which then
# produces confusing errors like:
#   No matching record found for external id 'model_<...>' in field 'Model'
# while loading security/ir.model.access.csv.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# IDE / OS artefacts
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
